== H.1 The Review Loop

+ Study the chapter and explain its key distinctions without looking at the text.
+ Attempt worked examples and the drill; record uncertain questions as well as errors.
+ Mark every answer and read its explanation. Classify each error as knowledge, interpretation or calculation.
+ Revisit weak ideas after a gap and try a fresh example rather than memorising an answer letter.

#rule-box("Protect practice data")[
  Use fictional or appropriately authorised records in exercises. Do not test another person's account or system without permission.
]
